<title>INDONESIA: Indonesian central bank seen checking rates.</title>
<headline>Indonesian central bank seen checking rates.</headline>
<dateline>JAKARTA 1997-07-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Indonesia's central bank, Bank Indonesia, was checking market prices for the rupiah in early trade on Monday, dealers said.</p>
<p>&quot;We hear the central bank is checking prices in the market. But we haven't seen any intervention yet,&quot; one said.</p>
<p>The rupiah plunged to a historic low of 2,630 against the dollar by 0325 GMT from a 2,510/20 as overseas investors mounted a fierce speculative attack on the currency. The central bank's intervention band was posted at 2,377/2,681 on Friday.</p>
</text>
